 "layoutSplit": {
  "change": "Storage version 3: the checkpoint and its schema key have their own row; the document row holds only doc_id and theme overrides. Version-2 documents (theme column beside the checkpoint) are refused. A theme command that changes nothing writes nothing. Saves, theme writes and duplicate use rusqlite transaction guards; duplicate checks and copies in one read transaction and reports a busy backup as Busy. Opening imports the checkpoint from SQLite's buffer.",
  "why": "SQLite rewrites a whole row on update: a theme save journalled and fsynced the full checkpoint and left a checkpoint-sized free hole until the next checkpoint; a duplicate's doc_id renewal rewrote the copied checkpoint.",
