 "foundationStabilization": {
  "change": "Refuse saved updates without a checkpoint before reading or appending; refuse shallow checkpoints, shallow saved history, and shallow imports into a live document. Correct the reorder benchmark. History pruning, JSON import, and publication optimization remain deferred.",
  "regressions": "Before the guards, all four missing-checkpoint tests and all three shallow-history tests failed for the intended reason. After the guards, all seven pass. Storage tests check that saved update bytes are preserved; live shallow-import refusal preserves the snapshot.",
